      "id": 141081,
      "name": "Pydro",
      "username": "Pydro",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-05-04T04:14:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No. You cannot use the same power on a single card twice a turn unless the card explicitly says so, like Overdrive.</p>\n<p>If you have two different cards in play, for example two Stun Bolts, then you can use the Stun Bolt power from each separate card with the additional power use.</p>",
